  "chain": "less-than-adequate EC abandonment procedure left dead-leg tubing/isolation valves unremoved [cause B] -> nitride-coated ferrule sensitized & corroded over time -> compression fitting separates -> NC unidentified leakage exceeds TS 3.4.13 limits -> controlled shutdown to Mode 5",
