  ],
  "notes": "Two co-equal causal factors described in narrative (corroded ferrule per most-probable-cause analysis, and inadequate EC abandonment procedure); both feed into the single official cause code B and are modeled as sequential FailureMode nodes since the unisolated dead-leg is what allowed the corroded fitting to remain an active pressure-boundary vulnerability. No backup system named as operable during the event (pressurizer low-level trip and defense-in-depth systems mentioned only as design-basis capability, not stated as active backups during this leak) so no BACKED_UP_BY edge emitted. Fitting manufacturer is only 'suspected' per narrative; retained as component per block 13 manufacturer code P070."
